7Q&oe=6B105370"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "City Run VR Ultimate", "keywords": ["Fitness", "Running", "Cardio", "Workout", "Jogging"], "long_description": "City Run VR Ultimate is the next-generation indoor cardio running experience designed for Meta Quest 2, 3, and 3S.\n\nTired of boring treadmills? Put on your headset, jog or run in place, and immerse yourself in a vibrant living city with realistic pedestrian life, traffic, and dynamic weather.\n\n\ud83c\udfc3 KEY FEATURES:\n\u2022 Natural VR Locomotion: Responsive motion tracking translates your natural jogging and arm swing into smooth in-game movement.\n\u2022 Real Cardio & Calorie Burn: Real-time sports HUD tracking instant speed (km/h & mph), active distance, elapsed time, and estimated calories burned.\n\u2022 AI Running Coaches & Ghost Competitor: Run alongside interactive pace coaches or challenge your own personal best ghost runner recorded in previous sessions.\n\u2022 Zero Equipment Needed: No expensive VR treadmill required. All you need is a 2x2 meter space in your room.\n\u2022 Multilingual Support: Full support in English, Italian, Spanish, French, German, and Portuguese.\n\nStart your journey today with our 3-Day Free Trial and transform daily workouts into an addictive fitness adventure!", "short_description": "Turn your living room into a high-energy running track! Jog in place, burn real calories, and explore immersive 3D cities with your AI coach."}]}, "developer_name": "FitnessVR", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://fitnessvr.it/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "FitnessVR", "support_website_url": "https://fitnessvr.it/", "website_url": "https://fitnessvr.it/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}], "external_subs